9 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-white mb-2\">Licensed &amp; Compliant</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm\">All operatives hold current licences under the relevant state and territory legislation. We operate within the law — always.</p></div><div class=\"bg-[#111827] rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-800 hover:border-[#c9a84c]/40 transition\"><div class=\"text-[#c9a84c] mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-white mb-2\">Absolute Confidentiality</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm\">Every engagement is handled with strict confidentiality protocols. Client identities, case details, and findings are never disclosed outside the authorised chain.</p></div><div class=\"bg-[#111827] rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-800 hover:border-[#c9a84c]/40 transition\"><div class=\"text-[#c9a84c] mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-eye\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2.062 12.348a1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 19.876 0 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1-19.876 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-white mb-2\">Evidence-Grade Standards</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm\">Our reports and documentation are prepared to court-ready standards from the outset. Chain of custody is maintained on every piece of evidence we collect.</p></div><div class=\"bg-[#111827] rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-800 hover:border-[#c9a84c]/40 transition\"><div class=\"text-[#c9a84c] mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-award\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m15.477 12.89 1.515 8.526a.5.5 0 0 1-.81.47l-3.58-2.687a1 1 0 0 0-1.197 0l-3.586 2.686a.5.5 0 0 1-.81-.469l1.514-8.526\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-white mb-2\">Professional Integrity</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm\">We are honest about what we find. If the evidence does not support the theory, we say so. Our clients rely on our integrity, not just our results.</p></div><div class=\"bg-[#111827] rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-800 hover:border-[#c9a84c]/40 transition\"><div class=\"text-[#c9a84c] mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-white mb-2\">Experienced Operatives</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm\">Our investigation team is built around licensed operatives and professional investigators selected for discretion, judgement, and reporting quality.</p></div><div class=\"bg-[#111827] rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-800 hover:border-[#c9a84c]/40 transition\"><div class=\"text-[#c9a84c] mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-white mb-2\">Results Without Excuses</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm\">We take on engagements we can deliver on and we deliver on what we take on. Our clients do not chase us for updates — we report proactively.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 px-6 bg-[#0d1426]\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-4\">Ready to Work Together?</h2><p class=\"text-gray-400 mb-8\">If you have an investigation requirement, we are ready to discuss it. Confidentially, professionally, and without obligation.</p><a href=\"/contact\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#c9a84c] text-[#0a0f1e] font-semibold px-8 py-4 rounded-xl hover:bg-[#b8943d] transition\">Get in Touch</a></div></section></main><footer class=\"border-t\" style=\"background:#060D18;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.05)\"><div class=\"max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 lg:py-20\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-10 mb-14\"><div class=\"sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-2\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-3 mb-5\" aria-label=\"Everguard Group\" href=\"/\"><svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 28 28\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 2L4 6.5V13.5C4 19.2 8.4 24.6 14 26C19.6 24.6 24 19.2 24 13.5V6.5L14 2Z\" fill=\"rgba(201,168,76,0.1)\" stroke=\"#C9A84C\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M10 14L12.5 16.5L18 11\" stroke=\"#C9A84C\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-xl font-bold\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-geist-sans);letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase\">EVER<span style=\"color:#C9A84C\">GUARD</span></span></a><p class=\"text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3 max-w-[300px]\" style=\"font-f